    "text": "\u00dea ealdan l\u00e6cas gesettan on ledenbocun, \u00fe\u00e6t on \u00e6lcum mon\u00f0e beo\u00f0 \u00e6fre twegen dagas, \u00fee syndan\n\u00de\u00e6s cunnode sum l\u00e6ce, let his horse blod on \u00fe\u00e6re tide, and hit l\u00e6g sona dead.\nNu synd hit \u00feas dagas, swa swa us seicga\u00fe bec: se forma d\u00e6g on martio, \u00fe\u00e6t is on hlydan mon\u00fee, and\nEft is on \u00fean mon\u00fee \u00fee we maios hatet se \u00feridda d\u00e6g dergendlic, and se seoue\u00fea \u00e6r his ende.\nOn iunius se teo\u00fea and \u00e6r his ende se fifteo\u00fea.\nOn iulius se \u00fereotteo\u00f0a and \u00e6r his ende se te\u00f0a.\nOn augustus se forma and \u00e6r his ende se o\u00f0er.\nOn september se \u00f0ridda and \u00e6r his ende se teo\u00f0a.\nOn october eac se \u00f0ridda and \u00e6r his ende se teo\u00f0a.\nOn nouember se fifta and \u00e6r his ende se \u00feridda.\nOn december se twelfta and \u00e6r his ende se seafanteo\u00f0a.\nOn ianuarius se forma and \u00e6r his ende se seofo\u00f0a.\nOn februarius se feor\u00f0a and \u00e6r his ende se \u00f0ridda.\nWe gesetton on foreweardan on \u00feysre endebyrdnesse \u00feone mona\u00fe martius, \u00fee menn hatat hlyda, for\u00fean\nNu \u00e6ft be \u00feam monan is miclum to warnienne \u00fe\u00e6t mon on fyuwer nihtan monan o\u00fe\u00fee on fif nihta men\nEac we gehyrdan seggan sumne wisne man \u00fe\u00e6t nan man ne lyfode, \u00fee him lete blod on ealra halgena\nNis \u00feis nan wigelung, ac wise men hit afundan \u00feuruh \u00fe\u00e6ne halgan wisdom, swa swa him gedihte godd.\nGyt her to eacan is to warnienne \u00fe\u00e6t man ne \u00feicge gosefl\u00e6sc on \u00feane \u00e6ftemestan d\u00e6i hlydan mon\u00fees,",
